Agent checklist (drop-in prompt)

Use this as the instruction chunk you hand to a Replit agent:

You are integrating the bildaid module `seo-flywheel-skateboard` into this website repo. Deliverables: 1) Create `/seo-flywheel` dashboard page that reads metrics from SQLite at `SEO_DB_PATH`. 2) Create a protected route `/api/seo-flywheel/run` (or equivalent) that triggers the daily controller job in `MODE=stub` by default. 3) Add scripts: - `seo:daily` runs daily controller - `seo:weekly` runs weekly measure 4) Add `.env` support using `templates/env.example`. 5) Implement the simplest adapters: - GSC export file adapter (reads JSONL from `GSC_EXPORT_PATH`) - CMS adapter in PR mode or stub mode 6) Make the system observable: - dashboard shows last run, counts, top uplift, recent errors 7) Add guardrails: - cooldown per page, dedupe by content hash - large diffs go to PR mode or todo mode 8) Provide a short runbook in repo root: how to run locally, how to schedule. Constraints: - Keep the controller single-file friendly. - Default to safe modes (stub/pr) unless explicitly switched. - Do not add heavyweight infrastructure (no warehouse required). 

